citation:        Web Server SRG SRG-APP-000141-WSR-000087 check and fix text;
                 web.conf.spec:297 (root_endpoint), web.conf.spec:308 (static_dir),
                 web.conf.spec:333 (tools.staticdir.generate_indexes, default 0),
                 authorize.conf.spec:150 (srchFilter)
finding:         Splunk Web does not declare the endpoint and static directory its users
                 are confined to, directory listings are generated, or roles carry no
                 search filter, so users and the searches run on their behalf are not
                 contained to the application's own tree.
